{:edb/db-before-t 1781 :edb/db-after-t 1782 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535094 50 #inst "2026-10-08T16:43:07.604Z" 13194139535094 true] [17592186087697 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330960 13194139535094 true] [17592186087753 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330936 13194139535094 true] [17592186087753 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330943 13194139535094 true] [17592186087753 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330950 13194139535094 true] [17592186330936 1017 #edb/ref 17592186330937 13194139535094 true] [17592186330936 1089 "q-104462" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330936 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535094 true] [17592186330936 1100 "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=2,{x}_{2}={x}_{3}=4,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $-5.$ Find $P(x).$" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330936 1113 #uuid "2f245d15-61bb-55e5-8528-9e0a762de9e0" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330936 1145 "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=2$ and ${x}_{2}={x}_{3}=4,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=-5,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =-5(x-2)(x-4)(x-4) \\\\  & =-5(x-2)(x-4)(x-4)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5(x-2)(x-4)(x-4) & =-5({x}^{2}-6x+8)(x-4) \\\\  & =-5({x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-6{x}^{2}+24x+8x-32) \\\\  & =-5({x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+32x-32) \\\\  & =-5{x}^{3}+50{x}^{2}-160x+160.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-5{x}^{3}+50{x}^{2}-160x+160.$" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330938 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330939 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330940 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330941 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330942 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1041 "selection" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330937 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330942 13194139535094 true] [17592186330