egin{aligned}-(x-2)(x-3)(x-3) & =-({x}^{2}-6x+9)(x-2) \\\\  & =-({x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}-2{x}^{2}+9x+12x-18) \\\\  & =-({x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+21x-18) \\\\  & =-{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-21x+18.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-21x+18.$" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330945 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330946 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330947 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330948 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330949 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1041 "selection" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330948 13194139535094 true] [17592186330944 1110 #uuid "252b2089-ffb7-5a9c-bacf-6a303fe970cf" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330945 1034 "-{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-21x+16" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330945 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535094 true] [17592186330945 1111 #uuid "6417af2b-0a47-592f-a594-dd629a924010" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330946 1034 "{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+21x-9" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330946 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535094 true] [17592186330946 1111 #uuid "ad448141-2f9c-5ab6-bfcf-d881d41f2395" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330947 1034 "{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}+12x+18" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330947 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535094 true] [17592186330947 1111 #uuid "75f361eb-8acf-59c0-b177-33e0828f1cf9" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330948 1034 "-{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-21x+18" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330948 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535094 true] [17592186330948 1111 #uuid "99cd8e08-829a-5197-b288-8b76545856b5" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330949 1034 "-{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-12x+22" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330949 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535094 true] [17592186330949 1111 #uuid "64a6683d-6c4f-5d36-ba30-c6bce9320788" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1017 #edb/ref 17592186330951 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1017 #edb/ref 17592186330954 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1017 #edb/ref 17592186330956 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1017 #edb/ref 17592186330958 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1089 "q-316632" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1100 "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=1,$ ${x}_{2}=-5,$ and ${x}_{3}=-2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $-4.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,-$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,-$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-4}}" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1113 #uuid "74c9a8e5-90b4-5268-8e9c-fc75ce69b404" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330950 1145 "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=1,$ ${x}_{2}=-5,$ and ${x}_{3}=-2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=-4,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =-4(x-1)(x-(-5))(x-(-2)) \\\\  & =-4(x-1)(x+5)(x+2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4(x-1)(x+5)(x+2) & =-4({x}^{2}+4x-5)(x+2) \\\\  & =-4({x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+4{x}^{2}+8x-5x-10) \\\\  & =-4({x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+3x-10) \\\\  & =-4{x}^{3}-24{x}^{2}-12x+40.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-4{x}^{3}-24{x}^{2}-12x+40.$" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330951 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330952 13194139535094 true] [17592186330951 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330953 13194139535094 true] [17592186330951 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535094 true] [17592186330951 1041 "field-1" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330951 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330952 13194139535094 true] [17592186330951 1110 #uuid "fe6bfdc1-e945-530e-86e5-2e1128d2ea21" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330952 1034 "-4" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330952 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535094 true] [17592186330952 1111 #uuid "d4d8838d-b303-5796-9a99-a76dd2698893" 13194139535094 true] [17592186330953 1034 "4" 1319413953